{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1069202,\"title\":\"The Date Whisperer\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Date Whispering is the hottest new trend in dating — a personal love coach right in your ear as you date your ideal match. And of all the date whisperers in LA, Sam is the best. But when the value of her service is called into question by her dad’s tennis coach, Mattie, she’ll learn the real worth of true love.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kTrxD5kHsCdCNrf5lOYGIEOwHTu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jfDWJGaVO8q2wR3Lxa6Ns1qf8XM.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"voteCount\":16,\"year\":2023,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"John Murlowski\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":110834,\"name\":\"John Murlowski\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tgTQjYtBou3IiJjpYgG17RNch9q.jpg\"},{\"id\":1948436,\"name\":\"Jenna Michno\",\"character\":\"Sam Mason\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/51URs3ZSlFjHnIcJ952dEdsUV9h.jpg\"},{\"id\":1582462,\"name\":\"John Ryan McLaughlin\",\"character\":\"Matt Cohen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uFXaeDTOnL0sDR0JRB9QpGuPTEt.jpg\"},{\"id\":2692769,\"name\":\"Skye Coyne\",\"character\":\"Jen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/clq2yJXCGHPnqZB5x78vX5hAgkN.jpg\"},{\"id\":4215265,\"name\":\"Anne Patterson\",\"character\":\"Milly\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cyPSAuMTPdJJsI9mPySGAdvgWdL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1214717,\"name\":\"James Hyde\",\"character\":\"Don Mason\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yXVBAL5h339cnSkjlZykS2Qsc9v.jpg\"},{\"id\":158223,\"name\":\"Rib Hillis\",\"character\":\"Frankie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8IsiYZyiYFosVoRcDAKqZjzQhla.jpg\"},{\"id\":3522241,\"name\":\"Nate Crnkovich\",\"character\":\"Wyatt\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gS4ejPGSFTbUCLmYSso86M7KlGj.jpg\"},{\"id\":3239523,\"name\":\"Andi Wagner\",\"character\":\"Breanna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7NUVb9xPlqZHyeUkXQojXz9PlTn.jpg\"},{\"id\":3054851,\"name\":\"Nancy Harding\",\"character\":\"Jo Law\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ekC4p3IjQzvfXIK9Ji7kZ6bBZom.jpg\"},{\"id\":64237,\"name\":\"Sascha Knopf\",\"character\":\"Gini\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fVCBzMsP4FEAfqo5Rf1lRpXATqN.jpg\"},{\"id\":3781695,\"name\":\"Shaun Boylan\",\"character\":\"James\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6X8WhIpbh3IlTY44vn0ed1XM4tY.jpg\"},{\"id\":555248,\"name\":\"Michael Scovotti\",\"character\":\"Doug Biggs\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ebYl4DkEhGEYjyT4ZV1GwuaS3Gt.jpg\"},{\"id\":3801315,\"name\":\"Brandon Delsid\",\"character\":\"Jason the Bartender\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ygQiTyEovHXLNR8xW9ZwJTeLve.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10947,\"title\":\"High School Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2p1nyBVSEBiCTrrZeVSV9nIsqHr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High's social order.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":35558,\"title\":\"Starstruck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kuyJuNiiZvu5iNr8Dgv5y75v1uc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nsWgxQrDcTVhSGzAu5kVlw64XB1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pop star Christopher Wilde has fame, fortune and a big-budget Hollywood movie awaiting him. But after meeting Jessica Olson, a down-to-earth girl from the Midwest, he is faced with following his heart or doing what's best for his career.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":643882,\"title\":\"The Princess Switch: Switched Again\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4vOmeimnVCdojwvc4icyeYUCydJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCHe8ckyufHVUZaoHu2DiF8evET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Duchess Margaret unexpectedly inherits the throne & hits a rough patch with Kevin, it’s up to Stacy to save the day before a new lookalike — party girl Fiona — foils their plans.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79113,\"title\":\"A Princess for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocyOdgL8pGS5KRpRfS69SsS2GMa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her sister and brother-in-law's tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law's father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":932430,\"title\":\"Prom Pact\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zVgRfuBvsFTU4mFvDt1Qlqo1CRo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jPKsE8cgehlau8V6YgNNVCMsoRK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's prom season, and high school senior Mandy and her best friend and fellow outsider Ben are surrounded by over-the-top \\\"promposals.\\\" Mandy is only focused on getting into her dream school Harvard, but as she starts tutoring basketball all-star Graham, she must re-evaluate whether her dream school is worth the cost of everything she believes in.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":70338,\"title\":\"A Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h94rbv7xBNJUgweD5pMK7cpqwMO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLBMZVAV75my1nFg4JR0fKOu4ho.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The television movie is set in the city of Dimmsdale and centers on the series' main protagonist Timmy Turner with his fairy godparents Cosmo and Wanda and his fairy godbrother Poof. In the movie, Timmy is now 23 years old but is still in fifth grade with his fairy-obsessed fifth grade teacher Mr. Crocker. Despite being grown up, Timmy finds a loophole in the fairy rulebook Da Rules: if he continues to act like a kid, he will still get to keep his fairies. However, the dilemma rises when Tootie, who was once a dorky girl when she was 10 years old, returns to Dimmsdale as an attractive woman. Timmy falls in love with her, a sign that he is growing up to an adult, which means he is closer to losing his fairies. Meanwhile, an oil business tycoon named Hugh J. Magnate, Jr., who teams up with Mr. Crocker, plans to use Timmy's fairies' magic in order to promote his oil business.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81393,\"title\":\"12 Dates of Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26X4Lldt6bwLnrX6kkLfUZTLojw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FwEg4xVszVPEq1Hj1GNqV208mm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an attempt to win back her ex-boyfriend Jack on Christmas Eve, Kate ends up ruining her blind date with Miles, a handsome guy she's been set up with. In a strange twist of fate, Kate is magically given the chance to re-live Christmas Eve twelve times!\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81250,\"title\":\"Geek Charming\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xweQBQSYQyHKiUxN1nCDQbLvJE0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5btPLADkUW3gxzIs25VdqRAOMtB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Film geek Josh is looking for the subject of his new documentary when a chance meeting puts the perfect star in his sights—Dylan, his school's most popular junior. But Dylan's hopes of using the film to become Blossom Queen don't quite match with Josh's goal to make a hard-hitting exposé about popularity. Will Josh shoot the film as planned, or show Dylan as the truly interesting person she is?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100642,\"title\":\"'Twas the Text Before Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e1fvQdD63RP2MS9jCB8jzg7fkdr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/498VjeTVd051iuEducr5MkZYKKf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Addie is a New York City chiropractor mistakenly receives a text from “Nana.” The accidental text turns into a loving friendship between the matronly Nana and Addie who now communicate regularly. Nana invites Addie to spend the holiday in Vermont. It is picture-postcard perfect and exactly as Nana described except for one surprise. Nana’s single son, James, a traveling doctor is also home for the holidays. Over three consecutive years, James and Addie are together during the holidays, though it isn’t until they are both single that they begin to see each other in a different light.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":961769,\"title\":\"Catering Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mmVZsiEYIN4AtRUCSJSIAZ8idjM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcAp3HYUCUdjMhulJagyOuKF3pg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fledgling caterer, Molly Frost, is hired by Jean Harrison, the perfectionistic director of the renowned Harrison Foundation, to cater this year’s annual Christmas Gala dinner. Things get complicated when Molly falls for Jean’s nephew, Carson, 30s, a travel photographer with no desire to take over the family’s foundation… until his aunt assigns him to the task of making sure the catered dinner goes perfectly.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4912,\"title\":\"Confessions of a Dangerous Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mM58ABMRzwn5zVx6BS7IiNK0j3F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uS03jRk64ZFFtpKNAhLppXa1nKP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Television made him famous, but his biggest hits happened off screen. Television producer by day, CIA assassin by night, Chuck Barris was recruited by the CIA at the height of his TV career and trained to become a covert operative. Or so Barris said.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"44tzLSFLkBc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,